BOSS Scorchion Reset
    Events
        Time - Every 5.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        ((Units in BossScorchionArea <gen> owned by Player 1 (Red)) is empty) Equal to True
    Actions
        -------- =================== --------
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Scorchion Fire Orbs Start <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Scorchion Fire Orbs Loop <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Scorchion Fire Orbs Temporal Instability Damage <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Scorchion Fire Ward <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Scorchion Fire Meteors <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Scorchion Blink <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Scorchion Random Aggro <gen>
        -------- =================== --------
        -------- Reset Boss + other starting initials --------
        Unit - Set life of BossScorchion to 100.00%
        Unit - Set Unit: BossScorchion's Real Field: Hit Points Regeneration Rate ('uhpr') to Value: 1000.00
        Unit - Set Base Damage of BossScorchion to (Base Damage of BossScorchion for weapon index 0) for weapon index: 0
        Unit - Set Unit: BossScorchion's Real Field: Scaling Value ('usca') to Value: 2.50
        Custom script:   call SetUnitPropWindow( udg_BossScorchion, 0.00 )
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in BossScorchionOrbGroup and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Unit - Kill (Picked unit)
        -------- Allow boss start --------
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Scorchion Engage Worshippers <gen>
        -------- Start Timer to Create new Dark Shamans --------
        Countdown Timer - Start BossScorchionResetTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 30.00 seconds
        -------- Issue Boss to starting location --------
        Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Center of BossScorchionSpot <gen>)
        Unit - Order BossScorchion to Move To VarPoint
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
        -------- turn off this trigger --------
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
